# Board-specific recovery properties for the Unisoc USB gadget.
#
# Values observed in the stock RMX3511 recovery environment:
#   sys.usb.configfs=1
#   sys.usb.controller=musb-hdrc.1.auto
#
# Set these during init so TWRP's USB configuration uses ConfigFS and the
# actual MUSB UDC instead of the legacy android_usb path.
on init
    setprop sys.usb.configfs 1
    setprop sys.usb.controller musb-hdrc.1.auto
